252	/// Shown while `statusStream` has no data yet. Blank for the happy path
253	/// (RNF01: no loading UI below 300ms), but surfaces a centered spinner once
254	/// the wait crosses that threshold — `auth-refresh` is retried by
255	/// `RetryInterceptor` on `NETWORK_TIMEOUT`/`NETWORK_OFFLINE`, so a slow or
